{"2071630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ExpressLane", "steam_appid": 2071630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Not a Battle Royale. Not a looter shooter. This is ExpressLane!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>high-stakes first-person extraction shooter</strong> where <strong>you bring your own island into battle.</strong> Build a fortress, loot everything in sight, raid your enemies, and escape before they take what’s yours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your island is your stronghold. Construct walls, place deadly traps, and upgrade defenses to protect your incubator—the key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge floating islands for rare gear, resources, and weapons. Every match is different, and the best loot won’t wait forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Attack rival players, break into their bases, and <strong>steal their wealth before they steal yours.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you’re ready to cash out, call a flying whale to extract. But be warned: <strong>extraction is the most dangerous part of the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight against other players and AI threats, from deadly ghouls to colossal boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <strong>grappling hooks, wingsuits, and jetpacks</strong> to navigate the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set deadly traps to <strong>defend your base, control chokepoints, and ambush raiders.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Think fast. Fight hard. Get rich.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you hesitate, someone else will take what’s yours. Will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Here's how it works!</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Match Loop</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter a live 30-minute match in the sky </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore floating islands for resources and loot </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build and upgrade your island during the match </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Raid other players’ islands for valuable loot </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend your island from incoming raids </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with what you can carry </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you build and bring back stays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your island is your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build it during matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players can raid it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can raid theirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You upgrade it with resources you find or take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fortify it with traps and defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the same island every match. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It grows as you get more powerful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Risk</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you carry is at risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you explore, the more valuable the loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more valuable the loot, the greater the danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you extract successfully, you keep what you found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose what you were carrying.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The map is different every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island layouts, loot spawns, enemy encounters, and objectives change each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden underground cities, powerful boss fights, and rare discoveries are scattered across the sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches unfold the same way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Your Way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore casually, focus on building, hunt bosses, raid other players, or chase high-risk loot runs. How you grow your island is up to you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Not a Battle Royale. Not a looter shooter. This is ExpressLane!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>high-stakes first-person extraction shooter</strong> where <strong>you bring your own island into battle.</strong> Build a fortress, loot everything in sight, raid your enemies, and escape before they take what’s yours.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/deb6be040b2bdf1009eb5c7c567b8220.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your island is your stronghold. Construct walls, place deadly traps, and upgrade defenses to protect your incubator—the key to your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/7fa3b5c766e86b47415ae505f59ba260.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scavenge floating islands for rare gear, resources, and weapons. Every match is different, and the best loot won’t wait forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/cfccf8f1514046b8b35ac04c5b2d04e2.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Attack rival players, break into their bases, and <strong>steal their wealth before they steal yours.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/f4812e63bf44783216913448471216c1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you’re ready to cash out, call a flying whale to extract. But be warned: <strong>extraction is the most dangerous part of the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/c855f7481c94ab9b0247973f91011c2f.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/aed9997000af9a0ca5e13fed5ca0edbb.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight against other players and AI threats, from deadly ghouls to colossal boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e2d1fe7926d7cccb4846faec685532ab.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <strong>grappling hooks, wingsuits, and jetpacks</strong> to navigate the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/24c59c49368b8c2ff0719c8485643a7d.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set deadly traps to <strong>defend your base, control chokepoints, and ambush raiders.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Think fast. Fight hard. Get rich.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you hesitate, someone else will take what’s yours. Will you make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Here's how it works!</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Match Loop</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/e369ef1d76735271674412587f2963a1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter a live 30-minute match in the sky </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore floating islands for resources and loot </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build and upgrade your island during the match </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Raid other players’ islands for valuable loot </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend your island from incoming raids </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with what you can carry </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you build and bring back stays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/8b2cc9da4748a08d337d63ec0d19f681.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your island is your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build it during matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players can raid it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can raid theirs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You upgrade it with resources you find or take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fortify it with traps and defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the same island every match. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It grows as you get more powerful.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration &amp; Risk</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/a2669d50a5fdc085233c79d4824f1dc1.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you carry is at risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you explore, the more valuable the loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more valuable the loot, the greater the danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you extract successfully, you keep what you found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose what you were carrying.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/2fd7bc8868b28c3636938ae6d591f3c8.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The map is different every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island layouts, loot spawns, enemy encounters, and objectives change each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden underground cities, powerful boss fights, and rare discoveries are scattered across the sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches unfold the same way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Your Way!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.poster.avif?t=1788216452\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.webm?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/extras/b0f5dd0e35cfa8d63f2790772305bfd0.mp4?t=1788216452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore casually, focus on building, hunt bosses, raid other players, or chase high-risk loot runs. How you grow your island is up to you.</p>", "short_description": "Your island comes with you. Everything else is up for grabs. ExpressLane is a free-to-play multiplayer survival FPS where squads bring persistent floating island bases into chaotic skybound matches. Build, loot, raid, fight bosses, and make it home before everything falls apart.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/119a03b95f645efbc7763cc17bfb3520b88c0b17/header.jpg?t=1788216452", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/8dd7178a3c513bd1ced74a011dd5cff1b608c374/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788216452", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2071630/8dd7178a3c513bd1ced74a011dd5cff1b608c374/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788216452", "website": "https://www.expresslaneinteractive.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen R5 1600 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version